From 4c5fd36affba65e3f38f9d4e36e0bb726c54b4f2 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Nathan Singh <nathan.singh@hotmail.com>
Date: Mon, 2 Nov 2026 10:08:48 +1100
Subject: [PATCH] Arena: a mechanics teacher with a topic menu

A teacher (sprite 0x66, which the lobby already loads: no extra sprite
memory) stands at (64, 208) facing east against the west wall of the corridor
below the upper hall, a new row after the scholar in both placement tables
(ACTOR_MECHANICS_GUIDE) and a talk trigger to BattleArena_MechanicsGuide
(scene/arena_menu.c). It loops MechanicsGuide_Choose (shop/shop/arena_class_viewer.c,
far call, import row): a 22 by 15 list window of six topics with the shops'
hand, A picks, B leaves; the topic's message is shown with the field message
window (2 to 5 pages, {page_break} and {end_wait}) and the list returns on it.

Topics: weaknesses, element power, damage, unleash chance, status chance,
physical or magic. Every statement was read from the code (battle_arithmetic.c,
arena_rules.c, ability.c, units.c, classes.c, the item and ability tables).
12 new messages above the generated cups block (scripts/add-mech-messages.py,
gen-cups.py re-run).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
