+"max PP / 8) x (1 + max\n"
+"PP / 1024), then x\n"
+"the element factor.{page_break}"
+"Ward: a party class\n"
+"takes 85 to 110\n"
+"percent of magic\n"
+"damage.{page_break}"
+"Summons add 2, 4, 6 or\n"
+"8 percent of max HP for\n"
+"1 to 4 Djinn, instead\n"
+"of PP bonus and Ward.{end_wait}"
+
+msgctxt "MsgArenaMechText3"
+msgid "10817"
+msgstr ""
+"Each Attack may\n"
+"unleash. Swords and\n"
+"axes: 30 percent. Maces\n"
+"25. Rods and staves 35.{page_break}"
+"Gear with Criticals\n"
+"adds its percent to\n"
+"the chance. 30 plus 10\n"
+"gives 40 percent.{page_break}"
+"Delusion stops all\n"
+"unleashes. Sword, axe\n"
+"and mace ones are\n"
+"physical; rod ones magic.{end_wait}"
+
+msgctxt "MsgArenaMechText4"
+msgid "10818"
+msgstr ""
+"Chance in percent:\n"
+"(level / 4 - Luck / 2)\n"
+"x 3 + base chance\n"
+"+ Ailment bonus.{page_break}"
+"Level is the caster's,\n"
+"Luck the target's.\n"
+"Add 25 if the target\n"
+"is weak to the effect.{page_break}"
+"Then x 100, 60 or 30\n"
+"percent by distance\n"
+"from the aim. Roll 0 to\n"
+"99: it must be below.{page_break}"
+"Luck 40+ is immune to\n"
+"Paralyze, Sleep, Charm,\n"
+"Haunt, Curse, Condemn,\n"
+"Taint and Poison.{end_wait}"
+
+msgctxt "MsgArenaMechText5"
+msgid "10819"
+msgstr ""
+"Physical: Attack, sword,\n"
+"axe and mace unleashes,\n"
+"most Djinn, PP moves\n"
+"like Dragon Cloud.{page_break}"
+"Magic: Psynergy,\n"
+"summons and the unleash\n"
+"of a rod or staff.{page_break}"
+"Physical hits use your\n"
+"Attack against its\n"
+"Defense. An element also\n"
+"uses Power vs Resist.{page_break}"
+"Magic ignores Defense.\n"
+"It uses your max PP,\n"
+"element Power, its\n"
+"Resist, and Ward.{page_break}"
+"Defend halves any hit,\n"
+"Total Defense takes a\n"
+"third. Agility: turn\n"
+"order. Luck: status.{end_wait}"
+
